meta {
  name: 5. Publish DataStructure Version
  type: http
  seq: 5
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/datastructures/:dataStructureId/versions/:versionId/publish
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:path {
  dataStructureId: {{sagaDataStructureId}}
  versionId: {{sagaDataStructureVersionId}}
}

docs {
  ## Setup – Publish DataStructure Version

  **Precondition:** `sagaDataStructureId` and `sagaDataStructureVersionId` are set (from steps 3–4).

  Publishes the version so it can be referenced by a DataSource.

  **Expected Response**
  - Status: `200 OK`
  - Body reflects the version in published state

  **System Impact**

  | System | Expected Change |
  |---|---|
  | Backend | Version status updated to published in `portal_backend` DB |
  | Model Atlas / Apicurio Registry | Version schema published at `modelAtlasUri`; verify in Apicurio Registry UI (`http://localhost:8888`) |
}
